  add("DAX fundamentals, calculated columns vs measures,","Asas DAX, calculated column berbanding measure,","DAX 基础、计算列与度量值的区别，","DAX基礎、計算列とmeasureの違い、","DAX 기초, 계산 열과 measure 비교,");
