  add("More than 7 years of teaching Python, mobile app development, Arduino electronics, and web development (HTML) to students aged 5 to 18, including special needs students. More than 3 years of experience teaching CSS, JavaScript, Java, and CyberSecurity. Has taught the IGCSE ICT Cambridge syllabus and has industry experience as a Software Support Engineer and Software Engineer. Also taught Bachelor students under a Master’s programme at UniKL, covering Network Operating Systems (Linux) and Arduino-based projects. Experienced with Raspberry Pi.","Lebih 7 tahun mengajar Python, pembangunan aplikasi mudah alih, elektronik Arduino dan pembangunan web (HTML) kepada pelajar berumur 5 hingga 18 tahun termasuk pelajar berkeperluan khas. Lebih 3 tahun pengalaman mengajar CSS, JavaScript, Java dan CyberSecurity. Pernah mengajar silibus Cambridge IGCSE ICT serta mempunyai pengalaman industri sebagai Software Support Engineer dan Software Engineer. Turut mengajar pelajar Ijazah Sarjana Muda di UniKL di bawah program Sarjana, termasuk Network Operating Systems (Linux) dan projek Arduino. Berpengalaman menggunakan Raspberry Pi.","拥有7年以上教授 Python、移动应用开发、Arduino 电子与网页开发（HTML）的经验，学生年龄从5至18岁，包括特殊需求学生。拥有3年以上教授 CSS、JavaScript、Java 与网络安全的经验。曾教授 Cambridge IGCSE ICT 课程，并拥有软件支持工程师和软件工程师的行业经验。也曾在 UniKL 硕士项目下教授本科生，包括网络操作系统（Linux）和 Arduino 项目，并熟悉 Raspberry Pi。","5～18歳（特別支援を含む）の学習者にPython、モバイルアプリ開発、Arduino電子工作、Web開発（HTML）を7年以上指導。CSS、JavaScript、Java、CyberSecurityは3年以上。Cambridge IGCSE ICTの指導経験があり、Software Support Engineer / Software Engineerとしての業界経験もあります。UniKLの修士プログラム下で学士課程学生にNetwork Operating Systems（Linux）やArduinoプロジェクトを指導し、Raspberry Pi経験もあります。","5~18세 학습자(특수 교육 필요 학생 포함)에게 Python, 모바일 앱 개발, Arduino 전자, 웹 개발(HTML)을 7년 이상 지도했습니다. CSS, JavaScript, Java, CyberSecurity는 3년 이상 지도했으며 Cambridge IGCSE ICT 교육 경험과 Software Support Engineer 및 Software Engineer 산업 경험이 있습니다. UniKL 석사 프로그램에서 학부생에게 Network Operating Systems(Linux)와 Arduino 프로젝트를 지도했으며 Raspberry Pi 경험도 있습니다.");
  add("More than 7 years of teaching Python, mobile app development, Arduino electronics, and web development (HTML) to students aged 5 to 18, including special needs students. Has strong expertise in electronics, including modern, digital, and analogue electronics. Experienced in teaching at Technical and Vocational Education and Training (TVET) colleges, specialising in mechatronics.","Lebih 7 tahun mengajar Python, pembangunan aplikasi mudah alih, elektronik Arduino dan pembangunan web (HTML) kepada pelajar berumur 5 hingga 18 tahun termasuk pelajar berkeperluan khas. Mempunyai kepakaran kukuh dalam elektronik moden, digital dan analog. Berpengalaman mengajar di kolej TVET dengan pengkhususan dalam mekatronik.","拥有7年以上教授 Python、移动应用开发、Arduino 电子与网页开发（HTML）的经验，学生年龄5至18岁，包括特殊需求学生。具备现代电子、数字电子与模拟电子方面的扎实专业知识，并有在 TVET 技职学院教授机电一体化的经验。","5～18歳（特別支援を含む）にPython、モバイルアプリ開発、Arduino電子工作、Web開発（HTML）を7年以上指導。現代電子、デジタル、アナログ電子に強く、TVET系カレッジでメカトロニクスを専門に教えた経験があります。","5~18세 학습자(특수 교육 필요 학생 포함)에게 Python, 모바일 앱 개발, Arduino 전자, 웹 개발(HTML)을 7년 이상 지도했습니다. 현대·디지털·아날로그 전자 분야에 강한 전문성을 갖고 있으며 TVET 대학에서 메카트로닉스를 중심으로 가르친 경험이 있습니다.");
  add("More than 3 years of teaching Python, mobile app development, Arduino electronics, and web development (HTML) to students aged 5 to 18, including special needs students. Has strong experience in business education, including evaluating students’ business plans and business pitching. Has worked as an IT Administrator and Customer Service personnel, and has experience as a freelance Business Analyst.","Lebih 3 tahun mengajar Python, pembangunan aplikasi mudah alih, elektronik Arduino dan pembangunan web (HTML) kepada pelajar berumur 5 hingga 18 tahun termasuk pelajar berkeperluan khas. Mempunyai pengalaman kukuh dalam pendidikan perniagaan termasuk menilai rancangan perniagaan dan business pitching pelajar. Pernah bekerja sebagai IT Administrator dan Customer Service serta mempunyai pengalaman sebagai Business Analyst freelance.","拥有3年以上教授 Python、移动应用开发、Arduino 电子与网页开发（HTML）的经验，学生年龄5至18岁，包括特殊需求学生。具备丰富的商业教育经验，包括评估学生商业计划与商业路演。曾担任 IT 管理员与客户服务人员，也有自由职业商业分析师经验。","5～18歳（特別支援を含む）にPython、モバイルアプリ開発、Arduino電子工作、Web開発（HTML）を3年以上指導。学生のビジネスプラン評価やピッチ指導などビジネス教育経験も豊富です。IT Administrator、Customer Service、フリーランスBusiness Analystの経験があります。","5~18세 학습자(특수 교육 필요 학생 포함)에게 Python, 모바일 앱 개발, Arduino 전자, 웹 개발(HTML)을 3년 이상 지도했습니다. 학생 비즈니스 계획 평가와 비즈니스 피칭을 포함한 비즈니스 교육 경험이 풍부하며 IT Administrator, Customer Service 및 프리랜서 Business Analyst 경험이 있습니다.");
